WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.046 --> 00:00:04.742
The spaceship fell through the clouds.

2
00:00:04.743 --> 00:00:09.375
Lucy pressed buttons on the control panel.

3
00:00:09.376 --> 00:00:12.772
"Nothing is working!"

4
00:00:12.773 --> 00:00:16.755
"It's the glitter!" Ringo said.

5
00:00:16.756 --> 00:00:19.126
"This is a new cruise.

6
00:00:19.127 --> 00:00:23.805
Nobody knew glitter hurts ships and robots!"

7
00:00:23.806 --> 00:00:30.768
Lucy nodded. "What do we do now?"

8
00:00:30.769 --> 00:00:34.005
"Just wait," Ringo said.

9
00:00:34.006 --> 00:00:38.226
Soon the ship was below the clouds.

10
00:00:38.227 --> 00:00:44.894
Ringo grinned. "The controls are lighting up again!"

11
00:00:44.895 --> 00:00:51.150
Bzzt! The pilot lit up too.

12
00:00:51.151 --> 00:00:56.682
"Tiny! Look out for the mountain!" Lucy cried.

13
00:00:56.683 --> 00:00:59.642
Ringo pulled a lever.

14
00:00:59.643 --> 00:01:04.275
Whoosh! The ship glided over the mountain.

15
00:01:04.276 --> 00:01:11.475
Then it splashed into the sea.

16
00:01:11.476 --> 00:01:15.288
"I'll fly us back up," the pilot said.

17
00:01:15.289 --> 00:01:18.088
"No!" Ringo said.

18
00:01:18.089 --> 00:01:21.795
Ringo told the pilot what happened.

19
00:01:21.796 --> 00:01:26.538
Lucy gulped. "We're trapped here.

20
00:01:26.539 --> 00:01:31.501
We can't fly back up."

21
00:01:31.502 --> 00:01:34.439
"Look up there!" Ringo said.

22
00:01:34.440 --> 00:01:41.874
"A clearing in the clouds! Let's go!"

23
00:01:41.875 --> 00:01:53.919
The pilot flew the ship off the planet.

24
00:01:53.920 --> 00:01:57.701
Soon they were back in space.

25
00:01:57.702 --> 00:02:00.976
Passengers cheered for Ringo and Lucy.

26
00:02:00.977 --> 00:02:16.164
"Hooray for Space Patrol!"

27
00:02:16.165 --> 00:02:23.526
"Welcome back!" Bot said.

28
00:02:23.527 --> 00:02:27.714
Ringo flopped on his bed.

29
00:02:27.715 --> 00:02:31.986
"Did you get some rest?" Bot asked.

30
00:02:31.987 --> 00:03:01.516
"Zzz . . . " Ringo was already snoring!

